OL,3,GNEWSANo cancellations for cruise liner
OL,4,Avisits to islands
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaving no cruise cancellations has been
OL,7,F"good news" for the Isles of Scilly,
OL,8,Fofficials said.
OL,10,FScillonian Marine Consultants said the
OL,11,Farrival of Fred Olsen's Bolette on
OL,12,FTuesday marked the last of 46 cruise
OL,13,Fliners which visited in 2026, carrying
OL,14,F19,000 passengers to the Cornish
OL,15,Fislands.
OL,17,FThe firm said there was not a single
OL,18,Fcancellation due to the weather, which
OL,19,Fit said was partly down to the islands'
OL,20,F"unique geography" and two dedicated
OL,21,Fanchorage spots providing shelter from
OL,22,Fpoor conditions.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
