OL,3,GNEWSANo cancellations for cruise liner
OL,4,Avisits to islands
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Council of the Isles of Scilly said
OL,7,Ftourism was "critical" to the
OL,8,Farchipelago and being able to welcome
OL,9,Fevery cruise liner had supported
OL,10,Femployment and businesses.
